Mate-Engine/Library/
Mate-Engine/Temp/
Mate-Engine/Logs/
Mate-Engine/UserSettings/
Mate-Engine/Obj/
Mate-Engine/Build/
Mate-Engine/Builds/
Mate-Engine/MemoryCaptures/
Mate-Engine/ProfilerCaptures/
